      The list row: photos, trigger, screens. One line, because a playlist's
      identity is its name and everything else about it is a consequence of those
      three. The trigger words come from the model's own label(), so the row and
      the editor's radio cannot disagree about what a trigger is called.
    -->
    <string name="playlists_row_summary">%1$s · %2$s · %3$s</string>
    <string name="playlists_surfaces_both">%1$s + %2$s</string>
